+     entry .unused   来自 `Unused` 选择的 `-Wunused:…`：全部、无，或特性的子集
+         `warnings.unused(Unused.All)` 是 `-Wunused:all`，`Unused.None` 是 `-Wunused:none`，而 `Unused.Subset(List(UnusedFeature.Privates, UnusedFeature.Locals))` 是 `-Wunused:privates,locals`。
